        "arrow_color": "#f6a27c",
        "card_eyebrow": "The six week course",
        "card_title": "Sketchbook Basics",
        "card_text": "<p>A drawing only helps if you do it again tomorrow.</p><p>Short video lessons, a prompt for every day and a live critique at the end of each week. By the last one you will have filled a sketchbook.</p>",
